00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:41.320
Untuk mengaktifkan Quick- Play Eja Super Polymerization !

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.900
Super Polymerizationgation !

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:46.120
Kenapa kau punya kartu itu ?

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.340
